      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In the short term, proactive and transparent communication is our primary tool to manage public perception and prevent unrest. We will launch a sustained public information campaign that clearly outlines the growing disparities while simultaneously presenting the tangible actions being taken to correct them. This involves regularly publishing localized data showing progress in certain sectors, building trust by demonstrating that the administration is directly aware of the social instability. By framing the current challenges within a visible corrective roadmap, we aim to maintain public confidence during the implementation phase.",
